<h1>PantryPal</h1>

<h2>Android Food Inventory & Expiry Management</h2>

<p>
  PantryPal is an Android application designed to simplify
  household food inventory management and help reduce food waste.
</p>

<p>
  The application supports barcode scanning using a device camera
  or compatible Bluetooth barcode scanner, along with receipt
  processing to assist with adding purchased products to inventory.
</p>

<p>
  PantryPal also provides expiry-date monitoring, stock-level
  management and shopping-list functionality, helping households
  identify products that need attention or replenishment.
</p>


